      "title": "New delete endpoints have no tests",
      "description": "The change adds two delete endpoints, and the repository has no test that calls either one. Nothing would catch a missing admin check or a broken purge in later changes. Add tests that check a non-admin gets 403 and that a purge with an unknown id fails cleanly.",
